column1:
10:4|From Judah comes the cornerstone,
from Judah the tent peg,
from Judah the battle bow,
from Judah every ruler together.|Names the collective referent for clarity and retains the fourfold from and all images.

10:7|Ephraim will be like a warrior;
their hearts will rejoice as with wine.
Their children will see and rejoice;
their hearts will celebrate in the LORD.|Preserves intergenerational joy and repeated heart/rejoicing language.
